      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border rank eight Gu Immortals at Yi Tian Mountain facing a black-robed immortal zombie name Carefree Wisdom Heart Physique as another of the ten extreme physiques, and list Carefree Wisdom Heart with Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance and Northern Dark Ice Soul among physiques appearing one after another.",
      "chapters": [
        969
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "physique-naming",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "sys_carefree_wisdom_heart_physique",
        "char_blazing_glory_lightning_brilliance",
        "char_northern_dark_ice_soul"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Green Lotus Great World, after Fairy Ming Hao fights Fang Yuan’s side, Lu Wei Yin senses something and asks “Carefree Wisdom Heart?” with peculiarity.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "suspected-identity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_green_lotus_great_world",
        "char_fairy_ming_hao",
        "char_lu_wei_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yellow Earth Great World, Lu Wei Yin states that Fairy Ming Hao possesses the Carefree Wisdom Heart Physique and also has humility Gu and pride Gu, which reminds him of the description in The Legends of Ren Zu.",
      "chapters": [
        2160
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "identity-confirmed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yellow_earth_great_world",
        "gu_humility_gu",
        "gu_pride_gu",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Legends of Ren Zu excerpt has Ren Zu’s mind explode from an overload of knowledge after humility Gu keeps him seeking more. The scattered knowledge forms a little girl who hugs his leg and names herself Carefree Wisdom Heart, his daughter.",
      "chapters": [
        2161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "birth-from-scattered-knowledge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Legends of Ren Zu excerpt states she was born intelligent and witty, and that Ren Zu liked his eighth child a lot, then has her store knowledge with Great Strength True Martial so they can keep seeking Wisdom Gu inside Qian Kun Crystal Wall.",
      "chapters": [
        2176
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "traits-and-knowledge-task",
